        "title": "Progestogens to prevent preterm birth in twin pregnancies: an individual participant data meta-analysis of randomized trials",
        "authors": [
          "E. Schuit",
          "S. Stock",
          "R. Groenwold",
          "K. Maurel",
          "C. Combs",
