        "title": "Antenatal corticosteroids trial in preterm births to increase neonatal survival in developing countries: study protocol",
        "authors": [
          "F. Althabe",
          "J. Beliz\u00e1n",
          "A. Mazzoni",
          "M. Berrueta",
          "J. Hemingway-Foday",
